# Virtual environment
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

#The processed dataset can always be rebuilt from the raw data and scripts described in the README. 
# Some output files (like full_wide_matrix.parquet, ~480MB) are too large for GitHub’s 100MB per-file limit, 
#so they shouldn’t be pushed.

processed_data/
 
#The full raw dataset (~19GB) is never committed to the repository. 
#Only a few small sample files are intentionally included, as explained in the README’s Data section. 

telecom_italia/data_2013_november/*.txt
telecom_italia/data_2013_december/*.txt
telecom_italia/data_2014_january/*.txt

# Explicit exceptions - the handful of sample files actually committed:
!telecom_italia/data_2013_november/sms-call-internet-mi-2013-11-01.txt
 
 
